  "description": "X.Org X11 libXi runtime library  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * libXi: libXi: Denial of Service via out-of-bounds read in XI2 class parser (CVE-2026-93543)\n  * libXi: libXi: Arbitrary code execution via oversized DEVICE_ENABLE reply (CVE-2026-109090)\n  * libXi: libXi: Arbitrary code execution via DEVICE_RESOLUTION heap-based buffer overflow (CVE-2026-109089)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
